inst:Mission_HARTE_HANKS_INC a msg:MissionStatement ;
    msg:missionText "Our mission is to partner with clients to provide them with robust customer-experience, or CX strategy, data-driven analytics, and actionable insights combined with seamless program execution to better understand, attract, and engage their customers. Our services include strat." ;
